\cf2 \strokec2 Welcome to my website. I graduated in August of 2024 from Iowa State University with a PhD in Economics. I completed my undergraduate degree at the University of Wisconsin - Eau Claire in Economics and Mathematics in 2019. I am a microeconomist with broad interests in the subject areas: Transportation Economics, Industrial Organization, International Trade, Labor Economics, and Environmental Economics.\
I am currently a Postdoctoral Researcher at the Swedish University of Agricultural Sciences. I work in the Environmental Economics group on a project titled 
\f1\i \cf2 \strokec2 Scrap and Grab: Should Sweden introduce a vehicle scrappage subsidy?
\f0\i0 \cf2 \strokec2 \
In my free time, I enjoy going for long walks and lifting weights. Current personal records on Squat, Bench, and Deadlift are 415lb/188.2kg, 305lb/138.3kg, and 500lb/226.8kg. I am consistently working to improve these numbers, and improve my research ability as an economist.\
